@baseUrl = https://localhost:5006

### Daily attendance report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/reports?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: ******

### Employee and location scoped exception report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/reports?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&employeeId=1&locationProjectionId=10&exceptionsOnly=true&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: ******

### Filter by effective attendance status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/reports?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&status=Late
Authorization: ******
